      },
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.94wLkbfz0zc6czXz]{05. The Ossuary Wall}.</strong> Dead antiquarian and surveyor. Stat block as in life, without the gear left in the camp; the Skulltaker actor holds the statistics the wall fights with. NPC Core Tomb Raider.</p>",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Great treasure awaits those willing to explore the hazardous depths of ancient tombs and forgotten dungeons. Some tomb raiders seek the riches of bygone eras; others recover pieces of history thought lost to the sands of time.</p><hr /><p>Explorers are often well-equipped and well-trained for any type of hazard and are eager to lead others into the wild.</p>\n<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>In life: a burly surveyor in mud-caked boots carrying the surveyor's chain. In death: a broad skull with a gold tooth.</p>",
      "publication": {
        "license": "ORC",
        "remaster": true,
        "title": "Pathfinder NPC Core"
      }
